{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0026_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "18dafe3f9857e472d7065eb130d69b1cace468de48073db16545207628469b19", "ja": "トゥインクルリズムVSギョーカイジン！", "zh": "『闪亮节奏』VS『业界怪人』！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0026_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "deb0524a1d5fafb6327ac699cfc31c7271552d4c567f15a7cc24770dc2d7d775", "ja": "完成した『魔法少女トゥインクルリズム』を\r\n劇場で鑑賞する一同。想像以上の仕上がりに\r\n驚く。しかし、これで終わりではない。\r\n悪のギョーカイジンとの戦いは続く！\r\nこれからも行け！トゥインクルリズム！", "zh": "大家一起在剧场观赏完成的『魔法少女闪亮节奏』，\n超乎想像的品质令人惊叹。\n但是，故事并未完全结束。\n与邪恶业界怪人的战斗将持续下去！\n以后也要继续奋斗！『闪亮节奏』！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0026_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_07_1000_null", "source_sha256": "726aecece2aa52cbf3998daa3075dcdd172b55ca12f9e054a2fd56ae92eac5df", "ja": "―イベントライブの数日後―", "zh": "──活动演唱会结束数天后──", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0026_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_07_1001_p", "source_sha256": "7d196c00232a7d42bfd4bfb320632302c2f7e52f2cb8fa4d2de876d52cac4ec0", "ja": "（制作から出来上がったビデオが届いた。\nさっそくみんなで出来上がったドラマの鑑賞だ！）", "zh": "（制作单位把完成的带子送来了。\n赶快和大家一起欣赏这出戏吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0026_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_07_1002_p", "source_sha256": "6249e09c215f3a4ced88bf7ab4ca973889891da9650c5f2188634f80421ecdbe", "ja": "（みんな固唾をのんで\nスクリーンの前から動かないな）", "zh": "（大家都看得屏气凝神，\n在萤幕前一动也不动呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0026_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_07_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "2344dc97daf40a340e6e4d0f4ad4ec1b77703b95826c286b3f171896a773f322", "ja": "『ハーッハハ！　悪を愛しアクはお鍋から取り除く！　\nギョーカイジン・ギロッポンの登場だ！』", "zh": "「哈～哈哈！深爱邪恶、将火锅的杂质全部去除！\n业界怪人木六本登场啦！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0026_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_07_1004_006mak", "source_sha256": "a08464d5b8a22b9be93e1d73ead29d13c3237c3e2c124cc6a40d3992a9c362f8", "ja": "『ほう、かわいいお嬢ちゃんじゃないか。\nボクとギロッポンでシースーでも食べないかい？』", "zh": "「喔？真是可爱的小姐。\n要不要和在下一起去木六本吃司寿啊？」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0026_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_07_1005_030iku", "source_sha256": "7fdc4f63d6d3855493053de375d71051ae12e11116d279fa555fa8bf975bf5f0", "ja": "『いやっ！　離して！\nわたしは目玉焼きがすきなのよっ！』", "zh": "「我不要！放开我！\n我喜欢吃的食物是荷包蛋！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0026_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_07_1006_030iku", "source_sha256": "74a012c3e1fb1ed08f9711ee606b5585728150d8e3c43db5b43ad749cc0b0175", "ja": "真さんの登場シーン、すっごくステキ！", "zh": "真姊姊登场的桥段真的好棒喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0026_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_07_1007_028ari", "source_sha256": "9c49177ad8dceb9c3f18cccb68a67fe0eb01a9cc37eb3e840f7330dcae45e332", "ja": "現場でも見ていましたけど、大きな画面で見ると、\nいつも以上に映えますね～！", "zh": "虽然已有在拍摄现场看过，但是在大萤幕上看，\n比平时更加震撼呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0026_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_07_1008_001har", "source_sha256": "ebcb97a39e5c4cff0a82ea53a1724c6e258873ab75fe30263d420c5c1bfcc61c", "ja": "『この子っぴ！　私たちが探し求めていた\n伝説のトゥインクルプリンセス！』", "zh": "「就是这孩子哔！她就是我们寻找已久、\n传说中的闪亮公主！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0026_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_07_1009_026yur", "source_sha256": "3b41f5ebe0ecea88cec8bf43d439ab3e81163fe6feb4e6926fa49866d07a295d", "ja": "『！！　そう、この子が！　やっとみつけた！\nぴーちゃん！　ラブプリズムをあの子に！』", "zh": "「啊！！原来就是她！终于找到了！\n小哔！把爱之棱镜交给她！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0026_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_07_1010_030iku", "source_sha256": "57c6ab9389216b2ddc17578cb42098d261b8c45aaa4ed772fb56c85bd8284bff", "ja": "『な、なにこれ、体にラブが……\nみなぎってくるよぉー！！』", "zh": "「这、这是怎么回事？我的身体……\n充满了爱──！！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0026_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_07_1011_028ari", "source_sha256": "9ac7c26eb73ad2fcddb7912b399106c1d1ed28c733fa2e676bd04afaea9c860a", "ja": "ふぉぉぉ！　特殊効果で、\n育ちゃんがキラキラですぅ！", "zh": "唔喔喔喔！小育经过特效加持，\n变得亮晶晶的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0026_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_07_1012_030iku", "source_sha256": "ceaa735f48ff08bff2ab7eebaf71acbbc913b09c94a9c236bf909311ecbab3ae", "ja": "うんっ、ほんとうの魔法みたい！\nすごいすごい！", "zh": "对啊！就像真的有魔法一样！\n好棒喔好棒喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0026_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_07_1013_028ari", "source_sha256": "c5a9f80ca4dfb91f034b4e4782c34884b02931125619ab3c21ab1570e79fac3f", "ja": "『やぁ～ん、シースー団が多すぎです！\n倒しても倒してもキリがありません！』", "zh": "「讨厌～太多司寿团了！\n怎么打都打不完！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0026_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_07_1014_026yur", "source_sha256": "0bfa913e6efba0d7fcc9ba6d88a4c001eaad7c724dfc254641afca4ca6dd80ab", "ja": "『アリサ、背中は任せて！\nいきなさい！　トゥインクルサイズ！』", "zh": "「亚利沙，后面的就交给我！\n去吧！闪亮镰刀！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0026_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_07_1015_028ari", "source_sha256": "f7e8c798443e52c4fceb622cfe59ccbbc378edbf6291d3b74167a57efff4b24b", "ja": "あ、あわわわわぁ～……。", "zh": "啊、啊哇哇哇哇……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0026_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_07_1016_026yur", "source_sha256": "60a30802ece99fd8dd4f69a72cccadfa0f042a183df0f32efcb8eb48af2a0272", "ja": "すごい……！\nあの時のアクション、こう見えるんだ……！", "zh": "好厉害……！\n原来那个时候的动作会变这样……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0026_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_07_1017_001har", "source_sha256": "aef04ca1ec28f240ef3c95a97f537fe2680980525b382252006b87becb63aa6e", "ja": "『今っぴ！　3人の力を合わせるっぴ！』", "zh": "「就是现在哔！三个人齐心协力哔！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0026_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_07_1018_006mak", "source_sha256": "f482e6ddb4c03d0430b270be89f6e20751e073a005dbea9e1456c53e940821dd", "ja": "『もう二度とカンパチの食えない体にしてやる！\nいけ！　シースー団！　シメのネタだ！！』", "zh": "「在下要让你们再也吃不了红𫠐！\n上吧！司寿团！最后一盘了！！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0026_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_07_1019_006mak", "source_sha256": "945dadd1003dea88a5a10a0e8c763d26ef026c72af358f630dfaf039f9154207", "ja": "『シャリ―！』", "zh": "「醋饭～！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0026_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_07_1020_026yur", "source_sha256": "27e914f7fa3ab425d2ea73b8d95c24a0bea095567a58f8b8cb34ad4cf8831502", "ja": "『そんな事はさせない！　\nだって今の私たちは最強なんだもの！』", "zh": "「才不会让你得逞！\n因为现在的我们是最强的！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0026_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_07_1021_030iku", "source_sha256": "0dfa41ab2ada7604078d74265df036d50837eecd5ce5ffdd8b328308b4f927eb", "ja": "わぁ～、百合子さんかっこいい！", "zh": "哇～百合子姊姊好帅！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0026_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_07_1022_026yur", "source_sha256": "374add63e806e8aad15d45b35bfc682d046b036bb7f56be7d67a07c5854d4d09", "ja": "今よ……！　そう、そこ……！", "zh": "就是现在……！没错，就是这边……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0026_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_07_1023_030iku", "source_sha256": "979877306a637041d8da9e5886f58ce61fabf6ddc88f20ee7dc1a424603990b4", "ja": "百合子さん？", "zh": "百合子姊姊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0026_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_07_1024_028ari", "source_sha256": "9053c7601a7d158342dba07140a9c538a57011a01571d4f17aebd2541ed1f35d", "ja": "『いきますよ、必殺！』", "zh": "「我们上吧，必杀！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0026_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_07_1025_030iku", "source_sha256": "bb55ed55868b3043aeaed77005aef439a7342503c55894b62b717df53908268f", "ja": "『トゥインクルトライアングルアタック！！！』", "zh": "「闪亮三角攻击！！！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0026_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_07_1026_006mak", "source_sha256": "ef517320c582dfae1bb6e41e470c28dfa2c3dc3535de7a7b6432a5b876d4f46d", "ja": "『オアイソッ……！！』（断末魔の叫び）", "zh": "「谢谢惠顾……！！」（临死前的惨叫）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0026_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_07_1027_se", "source_sha256": "f6737d6c2e53850b654d77c5eaa55b8e8ca19b30e649567c9bd469d551610c66", "ja": "ボカーーーーーーーン！！", "zh": "碰────────！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0026_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_07_1028_006mak", "source_sha256": "59c11e44ca194754bccc31afd1ca4a24a38cbd4c39263337ea64b4265d80b495", "ja": "『ぐぬぬ、こしゃくな！　覚えていろよ！\nギロッポンでは夜道に注意しろー！！』", "zh": "「唔唔唔，可恶！你们给在下记住！\n晚上去木六本时小心点！！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0026_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_07_1029_narration", "source_sha256": "ad1ef910ac10966313d07b1b960e2d14061969427d94a0651324294e2cb1435a", "ja": "『こうして平和は守られた！　しかしギロッポンの\n暗躍は続く！　戦え、トゥインクルリズム……！』", "zh": "「就这样，世界恢复了和平！\n但是木六本依旧会在暗中活跃！战斗吧，闪亮节奏……！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0026_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_07_1030_p", "source_sha256": "fb82e45730da7442b4afd1dbe4a3f8f8723ac3a73ce326d1677519021669aa62", "ja": "みんな、面白かったぞ！", "zh": "大家，这出戏拍得很好看喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0026_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_07_1031_p", "source_sha256": "7d64369c7289ea29b719b63b1705114bddf16381b8e331f3bef54453c7b49b5a", "ja": "亜利沙は……途中から目を背けてたけど\nどうしたんだ？", "zh": "亚利沙……你看到一半就别过头去，\n怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0026_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_07_1032_028ari", "source_sha256": "89b38aabd71a6cbaa1085ce4d710d3288b5e53c27c1fcd2ff49edbe46944ed12", "ja": "恥ずかしいんですよぉ！　うまくできたと思ったのに、\nありさの武器の鞭、髪にひっかかってたし……。", "zh": "因为很丢脸啊～！本来以为演得很不错的，\n结果亚利沙的武器鞭子勾到头发了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0026_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_07_1033_026yur", "source_sha256": "4859e4c54bb0f98aed918b4ce5ddffab9e66bde63afad1fa335be6138b6a1046", "ja": "すごい……すご……すご……い……。", "zh": "好厉害……好厉……好厉……害……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0026_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_07_1034_p", "source_sha256": "96fbc81a6152cffad2c4d4e5c5bc22e242db6c17b90719cbf2e0481e6493cccc", "ja": "（百合子は……大丈夫か？）", "zh": "（百合子……她还好吧？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0026_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_07_1035_030iku", "source_sha256": "d56db5be5c232ff06a9e53e11ab6fee2a8331f5553981450b15b48dfc0664203", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\nすーっごくおもしろかったね！　続編はないのかな？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n这出戏拍得好棒喔！会不会拍续集呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0026_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_07_1036_p", "source_sha256": "82db6d5279c1458a146127e7a6d548b92b4a952f5878142e2e4e8596c613d639", "ja": "ああ、そんな話が来ているよ。構想中らしいが\n是非お願いしたいって。", "zh": "续集啊，对方确实有来谈过。他们好像还在构思，\n说到时候一定要请我们再来演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0026_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_07_1037_030iku", "source_sha256": "8e1ec4305b0baef486a42c07c2da26ae54503492b6d268b122615145730793ec", "ja": "ええーっ！？　や、やったああああ！！！！", "zh": "真的吗！？太、太好了～～～～！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0026_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_07_1038_p", "source_sha256": "080ff9772784c6c737f6c3bd6fb21ddfee29286ea8a905b71f9935b91a1c6f60", "ja": "……って、亜利沙はいつまで照れてるんだ？\n照れてる顔もアイドルっぽくて可愛いけどな。", "zh": "……等等，亚利沙，你要害羞到什么时候啊？\n不过害羞的表情也很有偶像的样子，很可爱就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0026_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_07_1039_028ari", "source_sha256": "4d3c67ffbe6a417d30dd033758b2c3d2283113d3a0c3d9d5e517233bdb30373a", "ja": "か、可愛い……！？　……グハッ。", "zh": "可、可爱……！？呜哇！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0026_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_07_1040_p", "source_sha256": "fcb72ed2165ab257bf7774de87553613b24d6af3855283da5c527ba618ea7699", "ja": "（しまった。よけい恥ずかしくなっちゃったか）", "zh": "（糟糕，反而让她更害羞了吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0026_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_07_1041_p", "source_sha256": "3dd34e0c1db84aea32016aebc48d00d62f02722b40724960882dae804492de19", "ja": "えっと、百合子も恥ずかしいのか？　アイドルなんだし\nそろそろ自分の可愛さに慣れてくれよ？", "zh": "呃，百合子，你也在害羞吗？大家都是偶像，\n也差不多该习惯自己有多可爱了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0026_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_07_1042_026yur", "source_sha256": "b8471caca77cfd19d949aad1d2656bad8133706e0ef48fa9dccef3a3a64ebcd9", "ja": "か、可愛いって……そういう直球は本当に危険です！\n危険なんです！　恋しますよ、しちゃいますよ！？", "zh": "可、可爱……这样直接讲出来真是太危险了！\n太危险了！我会爱上你喔！没在开玩笑的喔！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0026_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_07_1043_p", "source_sha256": "53bbc5647f6ac13928f0cfec0d7321154adc4acb1de1823c278ff5da6ba2ee7e", "ja": "そ、そうか。なんか……ゴメンな。", "zh": "这、这样啊。该怎么说……抱歉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0026_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_07_1044_030iku", "source_sha256": "d7de8eee7529562039b505aea7fc2928605fdaa1a53334ad4a1cd4cde960312a", "ja": "もう、{$P$}さん！\n亜利沙さんと百合子さんをいじめたらダメだよ！", "zh": "真是的，{$P$}先生！\n不可以欺负亚利沙姊姊和百合子姊姊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0026_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_07_1045_p", "source_sha256": "576e91dea15f5dc928c657ef1913c4ea04bfaa6a2f673bdb371d80cb95c742af", "ja": "いや、いじめてるわけじゃないぞ？\n一応プロデューサーとして……", "zh": "不是，我没有欺负她们啊！\n我只是以制作人的身分……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0026_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_07_1046_030iku", "source_sha256": "41e1032a8777476304a7fdab703fa38d71a4098be183e13bb18029342fb9212e", "ja": "そんな悪いギョーカイジンさんには、\nトライアングルアタックしちゃうんだからっ！", "zh": "像你这么邪恶的业界怪人，\n看我用三角攻击惩罚你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0026_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_07_1047_030iku", "source_sha256": "c950cd43f0271b2cbbf1b1746803d550e3f4142c8b4ed3b9425dc8d94ee853ee", "ja": "えへへ。わかったら、もういじめないでね！　\nやくそくだよ！", "zh": "嘿嘿，知道错就好。不准再欺负人啰！\n一言为定喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0026_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_07_1048_p", "source_sha256": "6057e0dd7645edf823d47fae72faf9ceb500e2bc5e4946ccce3451df486ae3ad", "ja": "（魔法少女たちの物語は、ひとまずこれまで。\nだが、彼女たちの戦いは……）", "zh": "（魔法少女们的故事到此告一个段落。\n但是，她们的战斗……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0026_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_07_1049_p", "source_sha256": "1c13932086ec7c7df5b1314e81b816fb4ed6f250208e1841e83f996ccbff2bb5", "ja": "（まだまだ、幕を開けたばかりだ！）", "zh": "（才刚拉开序幕而已！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
